# Stack Test
# Titanium (Ti) — real density 4.506 g/cm³. three cubes stacked — simulate: collapse checks the load path.
scene "Titanium Stack Test"

bottom = cube 20mm material: titanium at (0, 10mm, 0)
middle = cube 20mm material: titanium at (0, 30mm, 0)
top = cube 20mm material: titanium at (0, 50mm, 0)
simulate: collapse
